          "en": "our meta tags in the head section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "But there's another important aspect of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 11.9,
          "en": "basically any website you're building that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.9,
